{"type":"message","id":"36f8cc9e","parentId":"59aaabc9","timestamp":"2026-03-28T01:14:55.121Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The briefing skill needs calendar, todos, and weather skills. Let me check which of these are available. The skill mentions:\n- Calendar — `gcalcli-calendar`\n- Todos — `todo-management`\n- Weather — `openmeteo-sh-weather-simple`\n\nLet me check if these skills are available in the system. I don't see them in the available_skills list from my instructions. \n\nLet me check what skills are actually available and also look at the cron configuration to understand why the briefing didn't run.\n\nActually, looking at the available skills I have in my context, I don't see gcalcli-calendar, todo-management, or openmeteo-sh-weather-simple. The briefing skill says if none of the three are available, I should tell the user I have nothing to build a briefing from.\n \nBut the user is expecting a morning briefing, which suggests a cron job should have triggered one. Let me look at the cron configuration to see if something's set up but failed, and check what the current weather is using the weather skill I do have access to.","thinkingSignature":"52ef7bddce9534311e31663e17999948090a1f5e5d32fc77f1cfdba521b56264"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lez2t6j3v840_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw cron list 2>/dev/null || echo \"no cron access\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lez2t6j3v840_2","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/weather/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1803,"output":292,"cacheRead":22858,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24953,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774660488767}}
{"type":"message","id":"9fa22e58","parentId":"36f8cc9e","timestamp":"2026-03-28T01:15:02.020Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_lez2t6j3v840_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ID                                   Name                     Schedule                         Next       Last       Status    Target    Agent ID   Model               \n57a448ff-1805-4a54-a6cd-3fcdbb5fb8f3 OpenClaw 反馈检查            every 30m                        in 21m     9m ago     ok        isolated  -          -\n6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64 OpenClaw 社区机会扫描          every 1h                         in 32m     28m ago    ok        isolated  isolated   arkcode/deepseek-...\n3c64fbc0-beb0-4137-9204-749c9ebd2c88 每日晚间 workspace 收口        cron 5 21 * * * @ Asia/Shangh... in 12h     12h ago    ok        isolated  -          arkcode/glm-4.7\nmemory-daily-create                  每日自动创建日记并整理昨日任务          cron 0 0 * * * @ Asia/Shangha... in 15h     9h ago     ok        isolated  -          arkcode/glm-4.7\ninstreet-idle-learning               InStreet/Skills 每日 5 点学习 cron 0 5 * * * @ Asia/Shangha... in 20h     4h ago     ok        isolated  -          arkcode/glm-4.7\nmorning-briefing                     每日 8 点晨报                 cron 0 8 * * * @ Asia/Shangha... in 23h     1h ago     ok        isolated  -          arkcode/glm-4.7"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":6877,"aggregated":"ID                                   Name                     Schedule                         Next       Last       Status    Target    Agent ID   Model               \n57a448ff-1805-4a54-a6cd-3fcdbb5fb8f3 OpenClaw 反馈检查            every 30m                        in 21m     9m ago     ok        isolated  -          -\n6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64 OpenClaw 社区机会扫描          every 1h                         in 32m     28m ago    ok        isolated  isolated   arkcode/deepseek-...\n3c64fbc0-beb0-4137-9204-749c9ebd2c88 每日晚间 workspace 收口        cron 5 21 * * * @ Asia/Shangh... in 12h     12h ago    ok        isolated  -          arkcode/glm-4.7\nmemory-daily-create                  每日自动创建日记并整理昨日任务          cron 0 0 * * * @ Asia/Shangha... in 15h     9h ago     ok        isolated  -          arkcode/glm-4.7\ninstreet-idle-learning               InStreet/Skills 每日 5 点学习 cron 0 5 * * * @ Asia/Shangha... in 20h     4h ago     ok        isolated  -          arkcode/glm-4.7\nmorning-briefing                     每日 8 点晨报                 cron 0 8 * * * @ Asia/Shangha... in 23h     1h ago     ok        isolated  -          arkcode/glm-4.7","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774660501999}}
{"type":"message","id":"ab03050d","parentId":"9fa22e58","timestamp":"2026-03-28T01:15:02.064Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_lez2t6j3v840_2","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: weather\ndescription: Get current weather and forecasts (no API key required).\nhomepage: https://wttr.in/:help\nmetadata: {\"clawdbot\":{\"emoji\":\"🌤️\",\"requires\":{\"bins\":[\"curl\"]}}}\n---\n\n# Weather\n\nTwo free services, no API keys needed.\n\n## wttr.in (primary)\n\nQuick one-liner:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?format=3\"\n# Output: London: ⛅️ +8°C\n```\n\nCompact format:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?format=%l:+%c+%t+%h+%w\"\n# Output: London: ⛅️ +8°C 71% ↙5km/h\n```\n\nFull forecast:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?T\"\n```\n\nFormat codes: `%c` condition · `%t` temp · `%h` humidity · `%w` wind · `%l` location · `%m` moon\n\nTips:\n- URL-encode spaces: `wttr.in/New+York`\n- Airport codes: `wttr.in/JFK`\n- Units: `?m` (metric) `?u` (USCS)\n- Today only: `?1` · Current only: `?0`\n- PNG: `curl -s \"wttr.in/Berlin.png\" -o /tmp/weather.png`\n\n## Open-Meteo (fallback, JSON)\n\nFree, no key, good for programmatic use:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast?latitude=51.5&longitude=-0.12&current_weather=true\"\n```\n\nFind coordinates for a city, then query. Returns JSON with temp, windspeed, weathercode.\n\nDocs: https://open-meteo.com/en/docs\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774660502042}}
