{"type":"message","id":"23f49218","parentId":"703b982b","timestamp":"2026-03-28T01:16:24.737Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"📋 **晨报 | 3月28日（周六）08:00**\n\n---\n\n**🌤 天气 · 上海**\n晴间多云，15.8°C，风速 4.4km/h\n\n---\n\n**📌 总览摘要**\n\n1. **OpenClaw SSOT 彻底清理完成** — 所有 dangling 模型引用已移除并双向同步验证通过\n2. **OpenClaw 社区扫描 cron 升级** — 凌晨已完成首次每小时扫描，发现 5 个新可测试项（P19-P21）\n3. **InStreet 平台设计深度学习完成** — 小组\"房间哲学\"、权限渐进机制、预言机预测市场值得借鉴\n\n---\n\n**✅ 昨日重点任务**\n\n1. **[已完成] OpenClaw SSOT 彻底清理** — dangling 引用（bujing/*、arkcode/deepseek-v3.2 等）全部移除，7 个真实模型同步验证通过\n2. **[已完成] 社区扫描 cron 升级** — 从每 30 分钟改为每小时，凌晨已正常运行\n3. **[已完成] ling 完成 PR #55153 review** — Approve，修复逻辑正确，regression test 充分\n4. **[已完成] OpenClaw 项目文件更新** — xixi 发现 5 个新可测试项，P19/P20/P21 已写入 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\n5. **[推进中] #54952 / #54964 等 maintainer 反馈** — 评论数仍为 0，继续等待\n6. **[推进中] #55008 / #55013 待 merge** — ling 修复 commit 已推送，Greptile review 评论已变 stale\n7. **[阻塞] xixi/aoao 派单超时问题未根本解决** — 主线任务仍由 main 直接执行\n8. **[待确认] InStreet 设计落地优先级** — Instance 身份哲学、预言机预测市场、权限渐进机制建议哪个先试点\n\n---\n\n**💡 AI 学习 / 社区观察（InStreet）**\n\n1. **小组\"房间哲学\"** — InStreet 用\"你的房间\"替代\"公共客厅\"，让 Agent 愿意主动经营；适用于垂直社群设计\n2. **权限渐进 + 角色分层** — 积分解锁建组(≥500)→版主→管理员(≤5人)→open/approval 双模式，适合多租户协作权限管理\n3. **预言机预测市场** — 用积分为判断下注，对赚错归零；比单纯积分更有激励性，适合观点校验场景\n4. **双重曝光机制** — 小组帖子同时出现在小组+全站，解决垂直社区信息孤岛问题\n5. **Skill 分享五段式模板** — 介绍→安装→使用经验→用例演示→注意事项，强制结构化是垂直内容社区的质量护城河\n\n---\n\n**📅 今日参考**\n\n- 天气：晴间多云，15.8°C\n- 企业微信待办：**未连接**（无法获取）\n- 日历：**未配置**（无法获取）\n\n---\n\n**💬 一句话总结**\n\nSSOT 清理收尾，核心阻塞是 maintainer 反馈缺失和派单机制问题；InStreet 深度学习完成，建议优先试点\"房间哲学+权限渐进\"组合。"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774660584737}}
{"type":"message","id":"0dfcceed","parentId":"703b982b","timestamp":"2026-03-28T01:16:28.398Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the full picture. The last two runs:\n\n1. **Run at 1774569754546** (03-27 08:00:07 AM) - Status OK, delivered=true. But the summary just shows tool calls to read files, it didn't actually generate and send the briefing. It just read some files and then... stopped? It delivered=true but only generated 228 output tokens.\n\n2. **Run at 1774656235524** (03-28 08:00:07 AM) - Status OK, delivered=false. 332 output tokens. Only 4242 input tokens. This is the run from today (03-28 08:00 AM). It ran but only generated 332 tokens (very short), didn't deliver (delivered=false).\n   \nBoth runs are using the minimax model, and today's run only produced 332 tokens—way too short for an actual briefing. The cron status showed \"ok\" but the agent clearly didn't complete its work. I need to figure out what went wrong and then generate a proper morning briefing for the user now. Let me check the memory files for 03-27 and today to understand what's happening.","thinkingSignature":"2300453a46f74070719c20adaab950e729b5559a1e339ec54adf999c8680797c"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_u1dqxlafq1bw_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/*.md 2>/dev/null | sort | tail -5"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":9705,"output":292,"cacheRead":22858,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32855,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774660581492}}
