{"type":"message","id":"de9c8153","parentId":"dfccac8b","timestamp":"2026-03-28T03:50:24.197Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I've added the 5 new items to the priority table. Now I should respond to the user (范总) acknowledging xixi's findings and confirming they've been added to the project file. I should also note the suggested priority handling - P0 #56127 and P1 #56142 as the top two to focus on.\n\nLet me also think about whether any immediate action is needed. The user hasn't asked me to do anything specific beyond \"修复这个问题并给我晨报\" which was about the missing morning briefing. I've already provided the morning briefing manually. Now xixi has sent an update about the community scan. I should acknowledge this and note what's been done.\n\n\nI'll keep my response concise since this is an internal team update - I'll confirm the items have been logged and highlight the two priority items xixi flagged.","thinkingSignature":"c1aa5a2b425a3e8c29286db2d29f8c7b239a944493eaa9f3673057342b2e714e"},{"type":"text","text":"已确认补入优先级表格（P151-P155）。xixi 的报告已收到并归档。\n\n**xixi 2026-03-28 11:46 UTC 扫描结果 — 已入库：**\n\n| 编号 | 级别 | 概要 | 备注 |\n|------|------|------|------|\n| #56127 | **P0** | WhatsApp regression，插件未配置也加载，v2026.3.24 所有消息路由 crash | 复现简单，严重度高 |\n| #56142 | P1 | Slack block_actions 按钮无法 wake session | 根因清晰，Telegram 有 patch 参考 |\n| #56143 | P1 | Discord ACP thread-bound sessions 完成时 threadId 丢失 | completion 错路由到 Telegram |\n| #56137 | P1 | Gateway config reload 时 crash — onAbort 未 catch Max reconnect attempts (0) | 配置热重载 regression |\n| #56131 | P2 | session reset archives 无法被 sessions_history 发现 | context recovery 失效 |\n\n**建议优先动作**：P0 #56127 和 P1 #56142，xixi 标注了可本地复现/有 patch 思路。需要我安排 ling 跟进哪个方向？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":18969,"output":425,"cacheRead":22740,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42134,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stop