{"type":"message","id":"7137f8e9","parentId":"de9c8153","timestamp":"2026-03-28T04:50:01.870Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-03-28 12:49 GMT+8] 🚨 **紧急: P0 安全漏洞 — OpenClaw #56173**\n\n**标题**: /pair approve bypasses admin scope guard via plugin command path\n\n**严重性**: P0 — 权限 escalation\n\n**摘要**:\n- `/pair approve` command handler 绕过了 RPC 层的 admin scope 授权检查\n- 根因: `approveDevicePairing()` 依赖 `options?.callerScopes`，plugin command path 未传入 `ctx.gatewayClientScopes`\n- 受影响: 有 `operator.pairing` 但无 `operator.admin` 的操作员，可通过 `/pair approve` 提权为 admin\n\n**详情**: https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/56173\n\n已在 `memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md` 中记录为 P0，建议立即确认是否需要 CVE 或紧急 patch。"}],"timestamp":1774673401865,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:xixi:cron:6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64","sourceChannel":"feishu","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}}}
{"type":"message","id":"7842600a","parentId":"7137f8e9","timestamp":"2026-03-28T04:50:16.475Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is an urgent P0 security vulnerability report from xixi. I need to:\n1. Acknowledge receipt\n2. Update the OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md with P0 priority\n3. Consider the severity - this is a P0 security escalation vulnerability\n4. Think about what action to take\n\nThe vulnerability: `/pair approve` bypasses admin scope guard via plugin command path. It's a privilege escalation where someone with `operator.pairing` but without `operator.admin` can escalate to admin via `/pair approve`.\n\nThis is P0 - critical. Let me quickly update the project doc and assess the situation.\n\nKey facts:\n- P0 security - privilege escalation\n\n\n- Currently needs to confirm if there's a CVE or emergency patch needed\n- I should post this to the designated reporting group since it's a critical security issue\n\nMy role here is to serve as the main coordinator - xixi brought this to me with a clear action needed, so I need to validate the severity, update the tracking doc, and determine the next steps.","thinkingSignature":"cb915d1e5410129fa4eeb140e1282934ac5efc20f8ad12df57b9506432796b63"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_4f7u20fm70bn_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -n \"P0\\|P151\\|#56173\" /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md | head -10"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":79,"output":271,"cacheRead":9602,"cacheWrite":31189,"totalTokens":41141,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774673401868}}
