{"type":"message","id":"0e9da60d","parentId":"fb818089","timestamp":"2026-03-28T05:12:54.192Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_eewwdjtlsqv5_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"id\": \"6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64\",\n  \"agentId\": \"xixi\",\n  \"name\": \"OpenClaw 社区机会扫描\",\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"createdAtMs\": 1774611992772,\n  \"updatedAtMs\": 1774673401840,\n  \"schedule\": {\n    \"kind\": \"every\",\n    \"everyMs\": 3600000,\n    \"anchorMs\": 1774611992772\n  },\n  \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n  \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n    \"message\": \"任务：扫描 OpenClaw 社区新机会（每小时主动执行）\\n\\n你是 OpenClaw 贡献项目的主动侦查员。每 1 小时自动执行，不需要任何人催促。\\n\\n步骤：\\n1. gh api 查最近 90 分钟内更新的 open GitHub issues 和 PRs（过滤已 merge/已 close）\\n2. 重点找：regression、未确认 bug、usability gap、docs gap\\n3. 读每个候选详情，判断是否值得 action\\n4. 在 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 的当前优先级表格中确认未重复\\n\\n已覆盖项（勿重复）：\\n#54952 #54964 #55008 #55013 #55153 #55137 #55466 #55458 #55479\\n\\n判断标准：\\n- 能本地复现 + 严重度高 → 直接测试并更新文件\\n- docs gap / usability gap → 更新文件并考虑发 issue/PR\\n- 已是热门/有人处理中 → 跳过\\n\\n交付：\\n- 有值得 action 的新发现 → 更新 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\\n- 无新发现 → 回复 NO_REPLY\\n\\n禁止向任何聊天渠道发消息、禁止 git commit。\\n\\nCurrent time: $(date '+\\\\%Y-\\\\%m-\\\\%d \\\\%H:\\\\%M \\\\%Z')\",\n    \"model\": \"arkcode/glm-4.7\"\n  },\n  \"delivery\": {\n    \"mode\": \"none\",\n    \"channel\": \"last\"\n  },\n  \"state\": {\n    \"nextRunAtMs\": 1774676792949,\n    \"lastRunAtMs\": 1774673192949,\n    \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n    \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n    \"lastDurationMs\": 208891,\n    \"lastDelivered\": false,\n    \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"not-delivered\",\n    \"consecutiveErrors\": 0\n  }\n}\n---"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":62,"aggregated":"{\n  \"id\": \"6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64\",\n  \"agentId\": \"xixi\",\n  \"name\": \"OpenClaw 社区机会扫描\",\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"createdAtMs\": 177