{"type":"message","id":"32a69123","parentId":"bc9a22cc","timestamp":"2026-03-28T05:13:28.406Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so feishu has `groupPolicy: \"open\"` which means group chats are open. But the bindings for each account are empty.\n\nNow the key issue: the cron session results are delivered to main via sessions_send, but main is NOT configured to then post those to the group chat `oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3`.\n\nThe user wants me to reply in the group chat `oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3` with OpenClaw project updates.\n\nBut wait - I don't have the group chat ID configured in any binding. The cron session results come to main via sessions_send, and then main should forward to the group. \n\nLooking at the feishu config, it's in websocket mode with requireMention enabled. The group chat ID is `oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3`, but there's nothing in the bindings that tells main how to reach it. The cron jobs are configured with `delivery: {mode: \"none\"}`, so they send results back to main via sessions_send rather than posting directly to a channel. The issue is that main isn't then forwarding those results to the group chat.\n\nI could set up a cron job to automatically post updates to the group, or I could use the message tool directly if the bot is already in that group. The simplest approach would be to create a daily cron that wakes up, reads the project file, and posts a summary to the group chat. I need to figure out the exact configuration needed for that delivery setting. I need to figure out the right configuration for posting to the group chat—whether it requires a specific binding in the feishu config or if I can just use the chat_id directly with the message tool. Let me start by testing if I can send to that group chat ID, and then I can set up a cron job to handle this automatically if it works.","thinkingSignature":"78c2577d293fa37524047517e5f4920f035dab43760662f033cac17849d25eeb"},{"type":"text","text":"群聊绑定是空的，所以 cron 汇报到 main 之后没有继续转发到群。按用户要求，我需要把 OpenClaw 项目进展发到 `oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3` 群。\n\n先测试能否发进去：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ljqw9e02p3yy_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"feishu","target":"chat:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","accountId":"default","message":"🔄 OpenClaw 项目进展同步（2026-03-28 13:12）\n\n**今日新发现（xixi 11:46 扫描）**\n- P0 #56127：WhatsApp 插件未配置也加载，v2026.3.24 所有消息路由 crash（可本地复现）\n- P1 #56142：Slack block_actions 按钮无法 wake session（根因清晰，有 Telegram patch 可参照）\n- P1 #56143：Discord ACP thread-bound sessions 完成时 threadId 丢失，completion 错路由到 Telegram\n- P1 #56137：Gateway config reload 时 crash — onAbort 未 catch Max reconnect attempts (0)\n- P2 #56131：session reset archives 无法被 sessions_history 发现\n\n**P0 安全漏洞进展**\n- #56173（/pair approve 提权漏洞）CVSS 9.9，根因已定位：plugin command path 未传 `ctx.gatewayClientScopes`，有 `operator.pairing` 无 `operator.admin` 者可提权\n\n详情：memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":21995,"output":786,"cacheRead":22858,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45639,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774674788304}}
