{"type":"message","id":"24776e4a","parentId":"257439a3","timestamp":"2026-03-28T05:13:43.425Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The message was sent successfully to the group chat. Now I need to set up the cron job to automatically forward OpenClaw project updates to the group chat.\n\nThe issue was:\n1. xixi's cron sends results to main via sessions_send\n2. But main never forwards to the group chat\n3. The community scan cron has `delivery: {mode: \"none\"}` so it doesn't post to any channel\n\nI need to create a new cron or modify the existing one to post updates to the group chat. Since the user wants this to be automatic, I should create a cron job that runs periodically and posts to the group.\n\nBut wait - I should think about the architecture here. \n\nThe real problem is that xixi's scan results go to main via sessions_send, but there's no automatic mechanism for main to forward relevant findings to the group chat. I could either create a dedicated cron job that reads from OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md and posts summaries to the group, or modify the existing workflow so xixi's scan results trigger an automatic post to the group whenever new findings are discovered.\n\nLooking at what the user actually wants—progress updates in the group when there are developments, not just periodic summaries—I think the cleanest solution is to set up a daily cron that checks the project file for updates since the last post and sends those to the group. That way, main's regular morning briefing gets shared to the group, and any significant developments that occur during the day get posted as they happen.\n\nFor the technical setup, I'd configure the cron with a feishu channel target pointing to the group chat ID, using a session agent to handle the actual posting.","thinkingSignature":"47607751135fe60a16ab3c94b31e8a561fa73f2d0c9f333abb768ffe11c284fa"},{"type":"text","text":"发送成功 ✅ 修复完成。\n\n**问题根因**：cron 的 `delivery: {mode: \"none\"}` 只回 main，不发群；xixi 通过 `sessions_send` 回报 main，但 main 没有配置自动转发群聊的链路。\n\n**修复**：现在手动发了，同时需要建立每日自动推送机制——我来配置一个自动发群的 cron：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_w83ffj5qnr8g_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw cron list 2>/dev/null | grep -i \"群\\|group\\|oc_f68e4447\\|同步\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":22915,"output":464,"cacheRead":22858,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46237,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774674809312}}
