{"type":"message","id":"69938234","parentId":"9573c3e1","timestamp":"2026-03-28T05:13:50.486Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No existing cron for group posting. Let me create one. I'll use `openclaw cron create` to make a daily cron at 9:00 AM that reads the OpenClaw project file and posts to the group.\n\nBut I need to figure out the exact command syntax. Let me check what format the cron create expects.","thinkingSignature":"ae69724dab1ef92cac8db0487ed82f9b84762d52697bedf5701d1cc43e0f057c"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_gejh4wo6f32w_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw cron create --help 2>/dev/null || openclaw cron --help 2>/dev/null | head -30"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":23401,"output":117,"cacheRead":22858,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46376,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774674826875}}
{"type":"message","id":"2e9f47b4","parentId":"69938234","timestamp":"2026-03-28T05:13:53.232Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_gejh4wo6f32w_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.3.11 (29dc654) — I'll butter your workflow like a lobster roll: messy, delicious, effective.\n\nUsage: openclaw cron add|create [options]\n\nAdd a cron job\n\nOptions:\n  --account <id>         Channel account id for delivery (multi-account setups)\n  --agent <id>           Agent id for this job\n  --announce             Announce summary to a chat (subagent-style) (default:\n                         false)\n  --at <when>            Run once at time (ISO) or +duration (e.g. 20m)\n  --best-effort-deliver  Do not fail the job if delivery fails (default: false)\n  --channel <channel>    Delivery channel (last) (default: \"last\")\n  --cron <expr>          Cron expression (5-field or 6-field with seconds)\n  --delete-after-run     Delete one-shot job after it succeeds (default: false)\n  --deliver              Deprecated (use --announce). Announces a summary to a\n                         chat.\n  --description <text>   Optional description\n  --disabled             Create job disabled (default: false)\n  --every <duration>     Run every duration (e.g. 10m, 1h)\n  --exact                Disable cron staggering (set stagger to 0) (default:\n                         false)\n  --expect-final         Wait for final response (agent) (default: false)\n  -h, --help             Display help for command\n  --json                 Output JSON (default: false)\n  --keep-after-run       Keep one-shot job after it succeeds (default: false)\n  --light-context        Use lightweight bootstrap context for agent jobs\n                         (default: false)\n  --message <text>       Agent message payload\n  --model <model>        Model override for agent jobs (provider/model or alias)\n  --name <name>          Job name\n  --no-deliver           Disable announce delivery and skip main-session summary\n  --session <target>     Session target (main|isolated)\n  --session-key <key>    Session key for job routing (e.g.\n                         agent:my-agent:my-session)\n  --stagger <duration>   Cron stagger window (e.g. 30s, 5m)\n  --system-event <text>  System event payload (main session)\n  --thinking <level>     Thinking level for agent jobs\n                         (off|minimal|low|medium|high)\n  --timeout <ms>         Timeout in ms (default: \"30000\")\n  --timeout-seconds <n>  Timeout seconds for agent jobs\n  --to <dest>            Delivery destination (E.164, Telegram chatId, or\n                         Discord channel/user)\n  --token <token>        Gateway token (if required)\n  --tz <iana>            Timezone for cron expressions (IANA) (default: \"\")\n  --url <url>            Gateway WebSocket URL (defaults to gateway.remote.url\n                         when configured)\n  --wake <mode>          Wake mode (now|next-heartbeat) (default: \"now\")"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":2724,"aggregated":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.3.11 (29dc654) — I'll butter your workflow like a lobster roll: messy, delicious, effective.\n\nUsage: openclaw cron add|create [options]\n\nAdd a cron job\n\nOptions:\n  --account <id>         Channel account id for delivery (multi-account setups)\n  --agent <id>           Agent id for this job\n  --announce             Announce summary to a chat (subagent-style) (default:\n                         false)\n  --at <when>            Run once at time (ISO) or +duration (e.g. 20m)\n  --best-effort-deliver  Do not fail the job if delivery fails (default: false)\n  --channel <channel>    Delivery channel (last) (default: \"last\")\n  --cron <expr>          Cron expression (5-field or 6-field with seconds)\n  --delete-after-run     Delete one-shot job after it succeeds (default: false)\n  --deliver              Deprecated (use --announce). Announces a summary to a\n                         chat.\n  --description <text>   Optional description\n  --disabled             Create job disabled (default: false)\n  --every <duration>     Run every duration (e.g. 10m, 1h)\n  --exact                Disable cron staggering (set stagger to 0) (default:\n                         false)\n  --expect-final         Wait for final response (agent) (default: false)\n  -h, --help             Display help for command\n  --json                 Output JSON (default: false)\n  --keep-after-run       Keep one-shot job after it succeeds (default: false)\n  --light-context        Use lightweight bootstrap context for agent jobs\n                         (default: false)\n  --message <text>       Agent message payload\n  --model <model>        Model override for agent jobs (provider/model or alias)\n  --name <name>          Job name\n  --no-deliver           Disable announce delivery and skip main-session summary\n  --session <target>     Session target (main|isolated)\n  --session-key <key>    Session key for job routing (e.g.\n                         agent:my-agent:my-session)\n  --stagger <duration>   Cron stagger window (e.g. 30s, 5m)\n  --system-event <text>  System event payload (main session)\n  --thinking <level>     Thinking level for agent jobs\n                         (off|minimal|low|medium|high)\n  --timeout <ms>         Timeout in ms (default: \"30000\")\n  --timeout-seconds <n>  Timeout seconds for agent jobs\n  --to <dest>            Delivery destination (E.164, Telegram chatId, or\n                         Discord channel/user)\n  --token <token>        Gateway token (if required)\n  --tz <iana>            Timezone for cron expressions (IANA) (default: \"\")\n  --url <url>            Gateway WebSocket URL (defaults to gateway.remote.url\n                         when configured)\n  --wake <mode>          Wake mode (now|next-heartbeat) (default: \"now\")","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774674833210}}
{"type":"message","id":"97bc1afc","parentId":"2e9f47b4","timestamp":"2026-03-28T05:14:11.632Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the `openclaw cron create` options. I need:\n- `--announce` to announce to a chat\n- `--channel feishu` \n- `--to oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3`\n- `--cron \"0 9 * * *\"` for daily at 9 AM\n- `--name \"OpenClaw 项目进展日报\"`\n- `--message` with the task to read OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md and post summary\n\nBut actually, the issue is that with `--announce`, the agent's reply gets posted to the channel. The agent would need to generate a summary. \n\nI should use a simpler approach where the cron job itself contains the message instructing the agent to read OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md and post the summary. The `--announce` flag ensures the final output goes to the group chat, so I need to craft a message that tells the agent exactly what to do when it wakes up.\n\nI'm setting up a daily cron at 9 AM Beijing time that wakes the agent with instructions to gather project updates since the last post, read from OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md, and post a concise summary to the Feishu group. The key is using `--announce` combined with `--to oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3` so the agent's response automatically routes to that destination.","thinkingSignature":"0cba00ceb45cf02350842db1251159dae065d4e6e8720f698b1ab0e027517189"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_9jroa7y0wswv_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw cron create \\\n  --name \"OpenClaw 项目进展日报\" \\\n  --description \"每日 9 AM 将 OpenClaw 项目进展同步到 oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3 群\" \\\n  --cron \"0 9 * * *\" \\\n  --tz \"Asia/Shanghai\" \\\n  --channel feishu \\\n  --to \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\" \\\n  --announce \\\n  --session isolated \\\n  --timeout-seconds 120 \\\n  --model \"arkcode/deepseek-v3.2\" \\\n  --message \"你是 OpenClaw 贡献项目的汇报员。每天定时向 oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3 群汇报进展。\n\n任务：\n1. 读取 /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\n2. 从「当前优先级」表格中提炼：\n   - 最新发布的 issue/PR（P0-P2 优先）\n   - 等到 feedback 的项（如有 maintainer 新评论）\n   - 任何高优先级更新\n3. 用简洁格式输出（参考以下结构，总字数控制 500 字以内）：\n\n🔄 OpenClaw 项目进展（YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM）\n\n【新/紧急】\n- P0/P1 新发现简述\n\n【等反馈】\n- 等反馈的项及当前状态\n\n【推进中】\n- 当前主攻方向\n\n详情：memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\n\n禁止：编造内容、发送给其他渠道、超长输出。\" \\\n  2>&1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":24192,"output":672,"cacheRead":22858,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47722,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774674833231}}
