{"type":"message","id":"fc8008cb","parentId":"fb924055","timestamp":"2026-03-28T11:06:37.121Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me also note the PR observations from xixi. Let me check if those PRs are already tracked.\n\nNow let me reply to the user about the scan results. The user is in a group chat (oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3) and the issue is that xixi is reporting to me (main) via sessions_send, but the group chat doesn't see these results.\n\nThe key issue: xixi's cron session uses sessions_send to report to main, which only shows up in my (main's) chat with xixi, not in the group chat. I need to relay this to the group.\n \nI should forward the scan results to the group now, and also ask whether they want xixi's hourly scans to continue going directly to them or if they'd prefer a daily digest instead.","thinkingSignature":"6ebc5bd8914424d2d21e201ef6d54a6edc36cf44c110051d8149a137c693c28c"},{"type":"text","text":"xixi 新报告已入库（P168-P171），同时发到群里让你知道进展：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_8p8kvgx1ft7z_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"feishu","target":"chat:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","accountId":"default","message":"🔍 **OpenClaw 社区扫描（xixi 19:04）— 4 个新发现**\n\n**P1**\n• #56347 — Subagent announce delivery 在 Telegram 报 'Outbound not configured for channel'（plugin registry mismatch）\n• #56326 — sessions_spawn 暴露 ACP-only 字段，破坏 runtime=subagent（PR #56342 已修复中）\n\n**P2**\n• #56338 — Feishu requireMention=false 配置无效，仍需 @bot\n• #56341 — message_sent typed hook 在 Telegram 不触发（v2026.3.24）\n\n**PR 观察**（已有人在修，可关注）\n• #56342 — 修 #56326（sessions_spawn ACP字段）\n• #56240 — 修 plugin registry mismatch（可能就是 #56347 的根因）\n• #56258 — gateway shutdown 加 per-subsystem timeouts\n\n详情：memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md（P168-P171）\n\n---\n⚠️ 注：xixi 每小时扫描通过 sessions_send 回报 main，结果只在主控私聊出现，不在群。明天 9 AM 那条正式汇报会同步到群。若需群实时看到扫描alert，另告知。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":26830,"output":540,"cacheRead":22392,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49762,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774695983563,"responseId":"0616e92f698f186dfaa68dff2479e615"}}
