{"type":"message","id":"3a053f01","parentId":"1226f33c","timestamp":"2026-03-28T12:58:20.090Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The log shows the gateway is running and the Feishu plugin is registering properly. There are no errors visible in the last 50 lines of the log. The Feishu channel appears to be working normally - it's just that with `requireMention: true`, messages without @mentions are silently discarded.\n\nThe user said \"飞书群聊是不是崩溃了\" - this could mean the Feishu group chat isn't responding to them. This is almost certainly the `requireMention: true` issue I already explained. Let me check if there are any recent error messages in the log from the Feishu channel specifically.\n\nActually, looking at the log - it shows the Feishu plugins are registering fine and the channel appears connected. The system is working correctly, it's just that without @mention, messages are being silently ignored.\n\n\nI'll send a message to the group to confirm it's actually working, since the user might be doubting the status despite my earlier explanation.","thinkingSignature":"84e2883a2c240d9981ac747dd15daad3df734388c62acb31ab80f311c50abcbd"},{"type":"text","text":"Gateway 正常运行，Feishu 插件也没报错。发一条测试消息验证一下：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ugx5lg3al2wd_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"feishu","target":"chat:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","accountId":"default","message":"✅ 飞书群连接正常（20:57）\n\n这条消息没有 @机器人，是通过 API 直接推送的。\n\n**如果你在群里发消息我没回**——因为 requireMention=true，没 @我 的消息 OpenClaw 直接静默丢弃，不是崩溃。\n\n群里只有 @我 才会触发对话式回复。确认一下你是否看到了这条？"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":35849,"output":371,"cacheRead":22568,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58788,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774702683814,"responseId":"0617035c43b2a0d5c58a2691644f04cb"}}
{"type":"message","id":"4403ca65","parentId":"3a053f01","timestamp":"2026-03-28T12:58:20.849Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ugx5lg3al2wd_1","toolName":"message","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"ok\":true,\"channel\":\"feishu\",\"action\":\"send\",\"messageId\":\"om_x100b534948040880b28bb306a4dbee2\",\"chatId\":\"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\"}"}],"details":{"ok":true,"channel":"feishu","action":"send","messageId":"om_x100b534948040880b28bb306a4dbee2","chatId":"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774702700830}}
{"type":"message","id":"56066d9b","parentId":"4403ca65","timestamp":"2026-03-28T12:58:26.828Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Sent successfully. Now let me also check if there's any issue with the cron job that was supposed to report at 9 AM. Actually wait, the issue the user is complaining about is that the bot doesn't respond in the group. This is definitely the requireMention issue.\n\nLet me think about whether to offer to fix it permanently. I should ask the user if they want me to change requireMention to false so the bot responds to all group messages without needing an @.","thinkingSignature":"f2d00e7b2d99a2d1c6a2a9ccac616be84deb28be8299b9aa6b6d96a2c82cb7ef"},{"type":"text","text":"\n飞书群没有崩溃，Gateway 和 Feishu 插件都正常运行。\n\n**实际情况**：飞书群消息需要 @我 才触发回复，这是 `requireMention: true` 的设计，不是故障。如果你希望 bot 对群里所有消息都自动回复，我可以改成 `requireMention: false` 并重启生效。要改吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":36295,"output":163,"cacheRead":22568,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59026,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774702700851,"responseId":"0617036cba11ecd8a0d2a8a7830e472d"}}
{"type":"message","id":"91409661","parentId":"56066d9b","timestamp":"2026-03-28T13:07:13.763Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5349692640a4b3b826ac70d8d3f\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-28 21:07 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b5349692640a4b3b826ac70d8d3f]\n范: 你在群里还是没回复我，我有@你了，你看看是什么问题"}],"timestamp":1774703233738}}
{"type":"message","id":"f0201970","parentId":"91409661","timestamp":"2026-03-28T13:07:21.330Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying they @mentioned me in the group chat but I didn't reply. Let me check the logs more carefully to see if their @mention message actually reached the gateway and what happened to it.\n\nLet me look at the logs around the time of their message (21:07).","thinkingSignature":"013619016321e3036afac3762d43eb25b6a59550b45bf78671762dd888e19e8e"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3mttr7hqmvjn_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep \"21:0[5-9]\\|21:1[0-5]\" /tmp/openclaw/openclaw-2026-03-28.log 2>/dev/null | grep -i \"feishu\\|inbound\\|route\\|mention\\|message\\|dispatch\" | tail -30"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80,"output":146,"cacheRead":9469,"cacheWrite":49270,"totalTokens":58965,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774703233763,"responseId":"06170581c62e9a642b31ddcf730114d1"}}
